					Plu.
					<u>Cam.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.34
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτῃ συγκατέζευκται κακῇ</span>
